R game that lets up to 4 players play in various game modes including 1v1, 2v2, Horse and 3-point contest. Pickup Basketball VR allows players to compete online with or against friends and players from across the world.\n\nThis basketball game is an immersive sports gaming experience like never-before utilizing the technology of VR.\n\nPickup Basketball VR utilizes unique technology in allowing  for a never-before experienced simulation of basketball featuring:\n\n- Realistic controls that involve dribbling, shooting, passing that brings you the feel of a true basketball game\n\n- Multiplayer mode where you can play other players online and test your skills in full play pick up games\n\n- Different court options including playground, gym, skyrise and more.\n\n- Customize your player avatar with a variety of options including face, skin tone, hair, jersey and other accessories", "short_description": "Pickup Basketball VR is a multiplayer VR game that lets up to 4 players play in various game modes including 1 v 1, 2 v 2, Horse and 3-point contest. Pickup Basketball VR allows players to compete online with or against friends and players from across the world."}]}, "developer_name": "Revog Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pickupbasketball.riffxr.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ron Revog", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pickupbasketball.riffxr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "SIMULATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "su